<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were a shade lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Tuesday. The three-month rate fell to  3.34 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 10 fix	    Sept 9 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.28 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.34 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.48 pct		3.50 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.63 pct		3.64 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.73 pct		3.75 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
